WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.461
Results are strong across the board.

00:00:02.541 --> 00:00:08.037
On node classification, CoCN gets the best average
rank, one point eight three,

00:00:08.117 --> 00:00:12.908
topping Chameleon at seventy-nine percent, Squirrel
at seventy-three,

00:00:12.988 --> 00:00:14.743
and Cornell at eighty-six.

00:00:14.823 --> 00:00:18.555
On graph classification, it wins five of six datasets,

00:00:18.635 --> 00:00:20.813
including COLLAB and IMDB-Multi.

00:00:20.893 --> 00:00:25.331
And on filtered Chameleon and Squirrel, with
duplicates removed,

00:00:25.411 --> 00:00:30.060
it ranks first of eighteen models, so its edge is
not data leakage.
